    "instrumentation_correction": "Initial unforced pure construction/encoding expressions yielded implausibly small timings. Those exploratory times were discarded; accepted timings use forced checks inside each interval.",
    "design": "Three sequential samples per level, exploratory host timings without randomization, load control, or population inference. Geometric/ordinary models share one input and checker; no fabricated pair of independent timing groups.",
    "library_scope": "Rule payloads, Bool parameters, decimal parent indices, and output index are included in the text size. The common local semantic lemma library, its implementation/proof sizes, and game/model parameters are external and not charged.",
